    <string name="passive_signal_noisy_rsrq_clicks_hint">During passive-only monitoring, mix white noise into 600 Hz tier clicks when RSRQ is below %1$d dB so poor signal quality is easier to hear. Click rate then follows RSRP only — RSRQ no longer speeds up the clicks.</string>
