    <string name="monitoring_2g_fallback_hint">When enabled, reads 2G signal KPIs (no ping tests on 2G). The no-signal tone still plays when 4G/5G is lost, even if 2G GSM remains. When disabled, 2G is treated as poor connection with the no-signal alarm and no ping tests.</string>
    <string name="monitoring_passive_quiet_alerts">Quiet passive alerts</string>
    <string name="monitoring_passive_quiet_alerts_hint">During passive-only monitoring, mute signal-tier clicks, cell-change bell, technology-change tone, and limited-service tone unless there is no signal, RSRQ is below %1$d dB, or RSRP is at or below %2$d dBm. The no-signal tone is always played.</string>
